34	/// Pumps [ExportStatusSheet] directly (bypassing `.show()`'s own
35	/// `showModalBottomSheet` ceremony) — same convention
36	/// `entries_filter_sheet_test.dart`'s own `_pumpSheet` helper uses; the
37	/// sheet's own rendering depends only on [cubit]'s state, never on being
38	/// inside a real modal route.
39	Future<void> _pumpSheet(WidgetTester tester, ExportJobCubit cubit) async {
