47	/// [cubit] already has its job created (`start()`) and one `getStatus`
48	/// result queued — this advances the cubit's own 2s `Timer.periodic` past
49	/// its threshold (same `tester.pump(duration)` convention
50	/// `meus_registros_screen_test.dart` already uses for its 300ms skeleton
51	/// timers) so the queued result is actually emitted before assertions run.
52	Future<void> _advancePastOnePoll(WidgetTester tester) =>
53	    tester.pump(const Duration(seconds: 2, milliseconds: 100));
54	
55	void main() {
