65	    // Review finding (self — debugging a hang): calling `BlocBase.close()`
66	    // a *second* time on an already-closed cubit never resolves its
67	    // returned `Future` inside a `testWidgets` fake-async zone (confirmed
68	    // via isolated repro — a single close(), even with a mounted
69	    // `BlocBuilder` and a live poll `Timer`, always resolves instantly;
70	    // only the second call on the same instance hangs). Tests below that
71	    // already close their own cubit (the live-Timer "Processando" case,
72	    // and `.show()`'s own `finally` block when "Fechar" is tapped) would
73	    // otherwise be double-closed by this blanket teardown.
74	    if (!cubit.isClosed) {
