102	
103	    // Non-terminal state: the cubit's own poll Timer is still live at
104	    // this point (unlike every other state above, each already
105	    // terminal, which cancels it on arrival) — flutter_test's own
106	    // "no pending timers" invariant is checked at the end of the test
107	    // body itself, before the outer `tearDown` block ever runs, so it
